\newlabel{tab:alt_specs}{{R.2}{8}{Holdout RMSE (mean $\pm $ std.\ over 20 random splits) for three model specifications across three pandemic periods (20\% held out). Bold indicates the lowest RMSE in each period. The rank-1 model outperforms both baselines in Periods~1 and~2; all models converge in Period~3}{table.caption.4}{}}
